OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including a live
OL,13,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall from
OL,14,     GTrio Gaspard performing music by
OL,15,     GFranz Schubert.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod invites you to
OL,18,     GRenaissance Rome, starting in a
OL,19,     Gsmall town outside of the Eternal
OL,20,     GCity, where our investigation
OL,21,     Ginto the origins of Giovanni da
OL,22,     GPalestrina begins...
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
