OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GCaroline Shaw and Andrew Yee
OL,6,     Gperform from their new album Or,
OL,7,     GThe Whale.
OL,8,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,9,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,10,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,11,     Gwith works by Takashi Yoshimatsu,
OL,12,     GMadeleine Dring and John Rutter.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GTchaikovsky juggles beauty and
OL,15,     Gsuffering, Benjamin Britten
OL,16,     Greflects powerfully on grief and
OL,17,     Gconflict, and Leonard Bernstein
OL,18,     Ggrapples with the modern world.
