OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,5,     FSt
OL,6,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a turning-
OL,7,     Gpoint moment in the life of five
OL,8,     GBlack female musicians, revealing
OL,9,     Glesser-known aspects of their
OL,10,     Glife and work, going behind
OL,11,     Gstereotypes.
OL,12,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,13,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,14,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,15,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,16,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,17,     Geverything in between.
