OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GThis week, London-based drummer,
OL,6,     Gpercussionist and bandleader Jas
OL,7,     GKayser is sitting in for Soweto
OL,8,     GKinch, sharing some exciting jazz
OL,9,     Greleases from the UK and around
OL,10,     Gthe world.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GThe Estonian National Symphony
OL,13,     GOrchestra performs Arvo Part's
OL,14,     GCantus in Memoriam Benjamin
OL,15,     GBritten, Rachmaninov's The Bells
OL,16,     Gand Thomas Ades's America: A
OL,17,     GProphecy.
